diff --git a/docs/development.md b/docs/development.md
index 0bca076..4f8fdfc 100644
--- a/docs/development.md
+++ b/docs/development.md
@@ -60,6 +60,20 @@ DATABASE_ADAPTER=mysql bin/ci
 
 The remote CI pipeline will run tests against both SQLite and MySQL.
 
+### Storage accounting
+
+`Board#bytes_used` and `Account#bytes_used` are persisted counters, updated by jobs
+on the `backend` queue. Each card image or Action Text embed on a board, card, or
+comment contributes its blob's byte size once per attachment. Unattached uploads,
+variants, avatars, and import/export files do not contribute.
+
+Existing installations are backfilled by the daily storage reconciliation job.
+To start it immediately after deploying, run:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'Storage::ReindexJob.perform_later'
+```
+
 ### Outbound Emails
 
 You can view email previews at http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/rails/mailers.
diff --git a/lib/rails_ext/active_storage_track_detached_embeds.rb b/lib/rails_ext/active_storage_track_detached_embeds.rb
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..bfbd85e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/lib/rails_ext/active_storage_track_detached_embeds.rb
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Unlike purge, Active Storage's many-attachment detach uses delete_all. Keep
+# the ids before deleting so the worker can retire just those storage entries.
+module ActiveStorageTrackDetachedEmbeds
+  def detach
+    if record.is_a?(ActionText::RichText) && name == "embeds"
+      ActiveStorage::Attachment.transaction do
+        record.embeds_attachments.select(:id).find_in_batches do |batch|
+          Storage::RefreshJob.perform_later(*batch.map(&:id))
+        end
+        super
+      end
+    else
+      super
+    end
+  end
+end
+
+ActiveStorage::Attached::Many.prepend ActiveStorageTrackDetachedEmbeds
